{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_299.json","id":242847,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Natural Whey Protein Chocolate","brandName":"MET-Rx","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"7 86560 17777 1","productVersionCode":"ACNU10935 17777 09F B100107 Part No. 30-43006","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"54","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":64068},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":66274},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":33489},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":64349},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":66275},{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":64349},{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":66275},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":66273},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":33488},{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":33489},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":33487},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":66275},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":33489},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":242861},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":64067},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":64349}],"contacts":[{"contactId":8869,"text":"Manufactured in the USA with select ingredients from around the world for","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_3.json","id":8869,"name":"MET-Rx Nutrition, Inc.","streetAddress":"","city":"Boca Raton","state":"FL","country":"","zipCode":"33487","phoneNumber":"1-800-556-3879","email":"","webAddress":"www.MET-Rx.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":5,"unit":"lb","display":"5 lb"},{"order":2,"quantity":80,"unit":"oz.","display":"80 oz."},{"order":3,"quantity":2.26,"unit":"kg","display":"2.26 kg"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":42,"maxQuantity":42,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":4,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1 scoop","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"when compared to our original formula"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Pre & Post workout\nFor best results and maximum muscle support, take one (1) scoop one to two times daily, especially after exercise."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein\nMET-Rx Natural Whey Protein utilizes state-of-the-art manufacturing techniques to deliver a cutting edge ultra-filtered 100% whey protein blend that is both wholesome and scientifically advanced. Non-GMO and with absolutely no artificial sweeteners, flavors or colors - MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein should be your first choice for high quality protein."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Non-GMO and with absolutely no artificial sweeteners, flavors or colors - MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein should be your first choice for high quality protein."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"What makes MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein worth it:\nMET-Rx Natural Whey Protein provides gold standard Whey Protein, which undergoes filtration processes to reduce total lactose and carbohydrates while concentrating the natural proteins.\nNaturally contains active Whey Protein Peptides and Microfractions including: Beta Lactoglobulin, Alpha-Lactalbumin, Glycomacropeptides.\nInstantized Whey Proteins for easy mixing and complete dispersion in liquid. \nQuick absorbing Whey Protein Blend to speed amino acid delivery to muscles immediately after workouts, to help stimulate muscle protein synthesis.\nContains naturally occurring Branched Chain Amino Acids."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Whey is the preferred protein source in sports and bodybuilding nutrition because it provides a superior source of Branched Chain Amino Acids – made up of Leucine, Isoleucine and Valine – which are important for the maintenance of muscle tissue. Unlike some other incomplete protein sources, MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein contains all of the essential amino acids required for supporting lean muscle."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"To support muscle-building, consume approximately 1 gram of protein per pound of body weight from all dietary sources per day."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein contains no aspartame."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Blender – Simple \nAdd one scoop of MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein to blender filled with 6-8 ounces of your favorite beverage. Cover and blend for 20-30 seconds. For a delicious smoothie, add peanut butter, fruit, or yogurt along with ice cubes.\nShaker - Simple \nFill a shaker bottle with 6-8 ounces of your favorite beverage. Add one scoop of MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein. Cover and shake for 25-30 seconds.\nGlass & Spoon - Simplest\nAdd one scoop of MET-Rx Natural Whey Protein to 6-8 ounces of your favorite beverage. Stir for 20-30 seconds or until completely blended.\nFor Mass Gaining: add higher calorie foods such as peanut butter, 1-2% milk, and fruit juices.\nFor Dieters: add lower calorie foods such as skim milk, blueberries and raspberries, or just use water. Use in conjunction with an intense daily exercise program and a balanced diet including an adequate caloric intake."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"New & improved taste"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No artificial flavors, colors or sweeteners\nGluten free\nNon-GMO"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"25g protein\n12 vitamins & minerals\nMore Protein\n"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Supports lean muscle and strength\nUltra-filtered"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Protein Powder Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains milk ingredients."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains milk ingredients.\nMade in a facility that also processes peanuts, tree nuts, egg, wheat, soybean, and sesame."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: Take one (1) scoop (42 g), one to two times daily. Serious athletes should consume 1 scoop 2-4 times per day for maximum muscle support, with at least 1 scoop taken immediately after exercise."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"As a reminder, discuss the supplements and medications you take with your health care providers."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: If you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medications or have any medical condition, consult your doctor before use."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use and consult your doctor if any adverse reactions occur."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not intended for use by persons under the age of 18.\nKeep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature and avoid excessive heat."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Tamper resistant: Do not use product if seal under cap is broken or missing."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical Amino Acid Profile (milligrams per 42 g scoop)\nEssential Amino Acids\nHistidine 559 mg\nIsoleucine 1,506 mg\nLeucine 2,710 mg\nLysine 2,287 mg\nMethionine 552 mg\nPhenylalanine 847 mg\nThreonine 1,973 mg\nTryptophan 425 mg\nValine 1,445 mg\nNonessential Amino Acids\nAlanine 1,444 mg\nArginine 762 mg\nAspartic Acid 2,895 mg\nCysteine 540 mg\nGlutamic Acid 3,693 mg\nGlycine 488 mg\nProline 1,478 mg\nSerine 1,464 mg\nTyrosine 773 mg\nL-Tryptophan is naturally occurring, not added.\napproximate values"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Copyright 2019"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Questions? Call toll free 1-800-55-MET-Rx To learn more, please go to www.metrx.com"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Contents are sold by weight. Some settling may occur."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2021-01-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":"","notes":"","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":42,"operator":"=","quantity":160,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Calories","category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Calories","uniiCode":"1","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":2,"ingredientId":4822,"description":"","notes":"","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":42,"operator":"=","quantity":2.5,"unit":"Gram(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":"=","percent":3,"footnote":null}],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":3,"ingredientId":18184,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":42,"operator":"=","quantity":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","dailyValueTargetGrou